  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You channel the holy light of the heavens.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Heavenly Radiance<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can expend mythic power to use the mythic or augmented mythic versions of any aasimar racial spell-like abilities you possess. If you can cast the spells of the same name, you can also cast the mythic versions of those spells, as though you had learned them with Mythic Spell Lore.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc25\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
